{"id": "1890412", "name": "אינטגרל מוכלל מסוג שני – חזקה ולוגריתם", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q10_IMPROPER_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">קבעו האם האינטגרל מתכנס, ואם כן חשבו אותו</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{{{CT:0}}} {{CT:1}}\\,dx\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>א.</strong> האם האינטגרל מתכנס? <span dir=\"ltr\">[[input:ans1]]</span> <span style=\"color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</span></div>\n<div><strong>ב.</strong> אם האינטגרל מתכנס, חשבו את ערכו. אם הוא מתבדר, כתבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\)</span>.\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q10_IMPROPER_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>הבעיה היחידה היא ליד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\)</span>. ידוע כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^\\varepsilon\\ln x\\to0\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\varepsilon&gt;0\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^p\\ln x\\)</span> אינטגרבילית ליד אפס אם ורק אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle p&gt;-1\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>כאשר התנאי מתקיים, פונקציה קדומה היא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{x^{{{CT:2}}+1}}{{{CT:2}}+1}\\ln\\left(\\frac{x}{{{CT:3}}}\\right)-\\frac{x^{{{CT:2}}+1}}{\\left({{CT:2}}+1\\right)^2}\\)</div>\n<p>האיבר בגבול התחתון שואף לאפס, ולכן ערך האינטגרל הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 5, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "תשובה מדויקת", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: if (converge and ans1 and is(equal(ans2,value))) or ((not converge) and (not ans1) and is(equal(ans2,0))) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "ant", "converge", "den", "f", "p", "shift", "up", "value"], "nvariants": 50}